# Shared by every Dockerfile here: BuildKit reads <name>.Dockerfile.dockerignore, which symlink to this file.
# Competition Data, secrets and build output never enter a build context.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/**
!contracts/proto/**
!cpp/**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!py/susq/**
!bridge_py/susq_bridge/**
**/__pycache__
**/target
**/build
